  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Flueggea virosa",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flueggea_virosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1351102312,
      "text": "Flueggea virosa, the common bushweed, simpleleaf bushweed, white-berry bush, snowberry tree, or Chinese waterberry, is a widespread species of flowering plant in the family Phyllanthaceae. It is native to the Old World tropics and subtropics; Africa, Madagascar and other Indian Ocean islands, the Arabian Peninsula, the Indian Subcontinent, southern China, Southeast Asia, Malesia, New Guinea, and Australia. It has also been introduced to Florida and Puerto Rico. Dispersed by birds, it has been assessed as Least Concern."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Flueggea virosa",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flueggea_virosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 158746152,
      "text": "Flueggea virosa, también \nconocida como Pompadour, \nKaukora, o lira, es una especie de planta de la familia de las filantáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Flueggea virosa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flueggea_virosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 214896696,
      "text": "Flueggea virosa, ou Flueggea acidoton, Phyllanthus virosus, Securinega virosa, Flueggea microcarpa, Securinega microcarpa, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs du genre Flueggea et de la famille des phyllanthacées."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Sigar jalak",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigar_jalak",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 30062255,
      "text": "Sigar jalak adalah tanaman perdu atau pohon kecil yang pada keadaan tertentu tingginya bisa mecapai 7 meter. Banyak digunakan sebagai tanaman pagar karena daunnya yang rimbun.\nTanaman ini salah satu species tumbuhan yang masuk dalam famili Phyllanthaceae. Perkembangbiakan tanaman ini sangat cepat. Hal ini dapat mengganggu ekosistem lokal, sehingga di Hawaii dan Tiongkok tanaman ini telah dinaturisasi. Buahnya yang berwarna putih sangat disukai hewan terutama burung. Di Indonesia tanaman ini memiliki banyak nama, di antaranya trembilutan (Jawa), atau simpeureum (Sunda) Molontiopo (Gorontalo).."
    }
  },
